    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers an open-world vehicle simulation experience. <br>The game is played from a first-person/third-person perspective of your custom avatar. <br>You can freely ride and dismount your vehicles at will, providing a more immersive vehicle simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both land and sea vehicles from the early ages of transportation. You can explore the world at your leisure, or engage in commerce by accepting transport jobs. <br>From early horse-drawn carts to massive sail ships, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a realistic yet simplistic approach to vehicle simulation, <strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers relaxed gameplay while you enjoy beautiful graphics in a highly optimized environment. <br>Manage your sails and crew, as well as your horses and carts. Play the way you want \u2014 whether you're focusing on exploration, trade, or both. <br>Buy and trade vehicles and properties, expand your fleet, and discover new places. You can also play with friends in cooperative multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include additional downloadable content (DLC) in the future, featuring new eras like the <strong>Industrial Era</strong> and <strong>Modern Era</strong>, with more vehicles and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: <strong>This is an Early Access version and not a fully finished game.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers an open-world vehicle simulation experience. <br>The game is played from a first-person/third-person perspective of your custom avatar. <br>You can freely ride and dismount your vehicles at will, providing a more immersive vehicle simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both land and sea vehicles from the early ages of transportation. You can explore the world at your leisure, or engage in commerce by accepting transport jobs. <br>From early horse-drawn carts to massive sail ships, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a realistic yet simplistic approach to vehicle simulation, <strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers relaxed gameplay while you enjoy beautiful graphics in a highly optimized environment. <br>Manage your sails and crew, as well as your horses and carts. Play the way you want \u2014 whether you're focusing on exploration, trade, or both. <br>Buy and trade vehicles and properties, expand your fleet, and discover new places. You can also play with friends in cooperative multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include additional downloadable content (DLC) in the future, featuring new eras like the <strong>Industrial Era</strong> and <strong>Modern Era</strong>, with more vehicles and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: <strong>This is an Early Access version and not a fully finished game.</strong></p>",
